### ============================================================
### 5) PROGRESS FLOW
###    - Test start / complete lesson, cập nhật progress
###    - Cần chạy 01 → 02 → 03 → 04 trước (đã có student ACTIVE enrollment)
###
###  SAU REFACTOR (V14):
###    - "Lesson có quiz" giờ được xác định bằng sự tồn tại section TEST
###      (xem 06-lesson-section-flow.http để biết cách tạo section TEST).
###    - Nếu lesson có section TEST → bắt buộc gửi `score` khi complete.
###    - Nếu lesson KHÔNG có section TEST → KHÔNG được gửi score.
### ============================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@teacherToken = {{teacherLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@courseId = {{createCourseN5.response.body.data.id}}

@lesson1Id = {{createLesson1.response.body.data.id}}
@lesson2Id = {{createLesson2.response.body.data.id}}
@lesson3Id = {{createLesson3.response.body.data.id}}

### ============================================================
### 5.1) Start lesson #1 (KHÔNG có section TEST → không cần score)
### ============================================================
# @name startL1
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.2) Complete lesson #1 (không score) — phải OK vì không có section TEST
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.3) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lại lesson đã complete
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.4) Start lesson #2
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.5) Complete lesson #2 (không score)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson2Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.6) Setup: tạo section TEST cho lesson #3
###       → sau khi có section TEST, lesson #3 mới được coi là "có quiz"
### ============================================================
# @name createTestSectionForL3
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "TEST",
  "title": "Mini test cuối bài"
}

###
@testSectionForL3Id = {{createTestSectionForL3.response.body.data.id}}

### ============================================================
### 5.7) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lesson #3 (có section TEST) nhưng KHÔNG gửi score
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": null
}

### ============================================================
### 5.8) Complete lesson #3 với score 85.5 (BigDecimal)
###   Lưu ý: Backend lưu bestScore — gửi score thấp hơn sẽ không ghi đè.
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": 85.5
}

### ============================================================
### 5.8a) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lại lesson #3 đã complete
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson3Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": 70
}

### ============================================================
### Note: cả 3 lesson đã complete → course progress = 100%
### → Enrollment tự động COMPLETED
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### 5.9) GET progress 1 lesson
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.10) GET toàn bộ progress trong course (kèm stats)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/progress/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.11) Kiểm tra enrollment đã COMPLETED
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollments/me/active
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5.12) (EXPECTED 400) Complete lesson không có section TEST nhưng gửi score
### → Tạo lesson #4 mới (không có TEST section) rồi thử complete với score
### ============================================================
# @name createLesson4
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bài 4: Luyện nghe (không quiz)"
}

###
@lesson4Id = {{createLesson4.response.body.data.id}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson4Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson4Id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "score": 50
}

### ============================================================
### 5.13) (EXPECTED 403) Start lesson khi chưa enroll
### → Dùng teacher token (chưa enroll) thay vì student
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/progress/lessons/{{lesson1Id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
